        </div>

        <h2>Living with PNH</h2>
        <p>
          PNH is a long-term condition, and living well with it involves more
          than drugs: pacing yourself around fatigue, knowing which symptoms are
          emergencies, managing work and family expectations, and dealing with
          the mental weight of a rare diagnosis. Our
          <a href={url('/patient-support')}>patient support page</a> covers the
          practical side, and we can put you in touch with others living with
          the same condition.
        </p>

        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href={url('/patient-support')} class="btn btn--primary">Patient support</a>
          <a href={url('/contact')} class="btn btn--secondary">Ask us a question</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
